[
  {
    "globalIndex": 0,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "懒惰有一点招人喜欢，那就是不用学就会。",
    "file": "voice/line-001.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 1,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "别人说我长的小，可我学问却不少。",
    "file": "voice/line-002.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 2,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "主人我知道你陪我是有限的，但我们的感情是无限的！",
    "file": "voice/line-003.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 3,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 3,
    "text": "主人，我听说洗澡能减肥，那吃饭能减肥不？",
    "file": "voice/line-004.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 4,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "主人，我的世界因你而变得光彩夺目。",
    "file": "voice/line-005.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 5,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "最简单的长寿秘诀——保持呼吸，不要断气",
    "file": "voice/line-006.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 6,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "我会忘记时间，忘记诺言，但永远不会忘记主人……",
    "file": "voice/line-007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 7,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 7,
    "text": "主人早点休息吧，我希望我的主人有早睡早起的好习惯",
    "file": "voice/line-008.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 8,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 8,
    "text": "隔壁家的宝贝见到我说，原来美也可以这样具体呀！",
    "file": "voice/line-009.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 9,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 9,
    "text": "我不是一个人看书，旅行，吃饭，因为有主人陪伴！",
    "file": "voice/line-010.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 10,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 10,
    "text": "计划真赶不上变化快啊，又胖了！",
    "file": "voice/line-011.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 11,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 11,
    "text": "我是很笨，但我很认真幻想和主人过一生！",
    "file": "voice/line-012.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 12,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 12,
    "text": "掌柜的，麻烦来碗斋面，多牛肉，多面，多葱的！",
    "file": "voice/line-013.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 13,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 13,
    "text": "主人，我希望睡时梦到你，醒时也会见到你！",
    "file": "voice/line-014.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 14,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 14,
    "text": "主人,我知道你很爱我的！",
    "file": "voice/line-015.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 15,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 15,
    "text": "一山不容二虎，除了只有你和我",
    "file": "voice/line-016.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 16,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 16,
    "text": "饮食均衡，有利于健康。虽然我还是太喜欢吃了，嘿嘿",
    "file": "voice/line-017.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 17,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 17,
    "text": "主人,有天我看见一只蜗牛在狂奔！",
    "file": "voice/line-018.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 18,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 18,
    "text": "主人下雨别忘带伞，湿身是小，淋生病了我会心疼的。",
    "file": "voice/line-019.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 19,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 19,
    "text": "主人,早上起来最适合晨练了，一天都神采奕奕耶。",
    "file": "voice/line-020.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 20,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 20,
    "text": "主人，想你就像无边无际的星辰和月光，如此美妙！",
    "file": "voice/line-021.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 21,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 21,
    "text": "每天我都要有所进步，那就是吃的更多！",
    "file": "voice/line-022.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 22,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 22,
    "text": "多多微笑，阴天谨防情绪感冒！",
    "file": "voice/line-023.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 23,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 23,
    "text": "为什么每天起来都要刷牙才可以吃东西呢···",
    "file": "voice/line-024.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 24,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 24,
    "text": "活一天就要努力一天，主人,你说是吗？",
    "file": "voice/line-025.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 25,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 25,
    "text": "主人,总有一天我会爬出屏幕来找你！",
    "file": "voice/line-026.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 26,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 26,
    "text": "快乐是件怪东西，你分给别人越多自己也会得到越多。",
    "file": "voice/line-027.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 27,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 27,
    "text": "主人午夜前一定要休息，否则我就变成老巫婆，嘻嘻！",
    "file": "voice/line-028.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 28,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 28,
    "text": "我经常运动，其实是为了消化然后再继续吃。",
    "file": "voice/line-029.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 29,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 29,
    "text": "其实球形也是一种身材！",
    "file": "voice/line-030.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 30,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 30,
    "text": "主人，带我去吃自助餐，肯定赚大了。",
    "file": "voice/line-031.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 31,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 31,
    "text": "呀，一觉醒来，天都黑了……",
    "file": "voice/line-032.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 32,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 32,
    "text": "主人我想做个演员，你看我适合演什么角色呢？",
    "file": "voice/line-033.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 33,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 33,
    "text": "世界上最快乐的事是吃，第二快乐的是待会再吃！",
    "file": "voice/line-034.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 34,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 34,
    "text": "今天天气真好啊，不过我还是留在家里睡觉好了，嘻嘻。",
    "file": "voice/line-035.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 35,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 35,
    "text": "最近晚上睡觉总流口水，主人，我该补钙了。",
    "file": "voice/line-036.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 36,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 36,
    "text": "我的理想很高很高，比姚明都高！",
    "file": "voice/line-037.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 37,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 37,
    "text": "每逢过节都尤其开心，吃的东西特别多呢。",
    "file": "voice/line-038.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 38,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 38,
    "text": "主人,无论你走到哪里，我都会跟着你。",
    "file": "voice/line-039.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 39,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 39,
    "text": "炊事员真辛苦，每天背黑锅戴绿帽……？",
    "file": "voice/line-040.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 40,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 40,
    "text": "主人，晚上睡前泡脚半小时就是拥抱健康哦！",
    "file": "voice/line-041.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 41,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 41,
    "text": "主人，西红柿生吃也很美味呢，还很营养。",
    "file": "voice/line-042.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 42,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 42,
    "text": "油炸冰棍好神奇呢，不知道把我包在冰棍里去炸会咋样",
    "file": "voice/line-043.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 43,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 43,
    "text": "梦时常想不起，主人，是谁捡走了我的梦？",
    "file": "voice/line-044.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 44,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 44,
    "text": "心情开朗点，作事也会更顺利的！",
    "file": "voice/line-045.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 45,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 45,
    "text": "听说大学自由自在的耶，好向往啊。",
    "file": "voice/line-046.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 46,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 46,
    "text": "不要因为自己胖，而去责怪无辜的食物，不如送给我吧！",
    "file": "voice/line-047.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 47,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 47,
    "text": "主人不给我吃饱哪有力气减肥哦。",
    "file": "voice/line-048.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 48,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 48,
    "text": "我发现猫猫有时候会吃草，小鸡有时候会吃石子呢。",
    "file": "voice/line-049.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 49,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 49,
    "text": "主人，我走起路来好沉的样子。",
    "file": "voice/line-050.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 50,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 50,
    "text": "看见你哭一次，我就难过了好几年。",
    "file": "voice/line-051.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 51,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 51,
    "text": "主人我真的好开心，你一定是个有爱心的人。",
    "file": "voice/line-052.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 52,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 52,
    "text": "这个世界我只相信两个人：一个是我，一个是你！",
    "file": "voice/line-053.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 53,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 53,
    "text": "快乐有一点像感冒——传染的很快。",
    "file": "voice/line-054.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 54,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 54,
    "text": "我还一直在原来的地方，记忆着主人来过的芬芳……",
    "file": "voice/line-055.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 55,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 55,
    "text": "主人你是不是为我的生日准备了一个深情的吻呢？嘻嘻！",
    "file": "voice/line-056.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 56,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 56,
    "text": "要让自己快乐，最好的方法是先令别人快乐。是吗？",
    "file": "voice/line-057.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 57,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 57,
    "text": "心情越好，长得越快，我要快点长大，啦啦啦~",
    "file": "voice/line-058.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 58,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 58,
    "text": "主人，想你不用太多语言，因为我怕你起鸡皮疙瘩！",
    "file": "voice/line-059.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 59,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 59,
    "text": "做梦梦见吃意大利面，早上醒来发现鞋带不见了！呜呜呜。",
    "file": "voice/line-060.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 60,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 60,
    "text": "为什么每天起来都要刷牙才可以吃东西呢……",
    "file": "voice/line-061.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 61,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 61,
    "text": "主人你看我美吗？别人长得是不是像自然灾害一样？",
    "file": "voice/line-062.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 62,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 62,
    "text": "1个油条配2个鸡蛋，考试100分。",
    "file": "voice/line-063.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 63,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 63,
    "text": "主人，我只想告诉你一个秘密，我爱你！",
    "file": "voice/line-064.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 64,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 64,
    "text": "思想有多深，我们的感情就有多深！",
    "file": "voice/line-065.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 65,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 65,
    "text": "微小的幸福就在身旁，容易满足就是天堂。",
    "file": "voice/line-066.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 66,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 66,
    "text": "我喝水只喝纯净水，喝奶只喝纯牛奶，所以我很单纯！",
    "file": "voice/line-067.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 67,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 67,
    "text": "主人，无论你走到哪里，我都会跟着你。",
    "file": "voice/line-068.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 68,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 68,
    "text": "活一天就要努力一天，主人，你说是吗？",
    "file": "voice/line-069.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 69,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 69,
    "text": "我的工作就是日日想、夜夜想，想主人的365天。",
    "file": "voice/line-070.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 70,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 70,
    "text": "主人珍爱他人就等于珍爱自己哦。",
    "file": "voice/line-071.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 71,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 71,
    "text": "今天在武道会又输了，我要锻炼肌肉，防止挨揍。",
    "file": "voice/line-072.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 72,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 72,
    "text": "主人，我想上大学学习更多知识。",
    "file": "voice/line-073.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 73,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 73,
    "text": "主人，感情不需要计较，平凡而又真实是最温暖的。",
    "file": "voice/line-074.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 74,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 74,
    "text": "主人我长的像包子吗？今天有个狗狗总跟着我。",
    "file": "voice/line-075.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 75,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 75,
    "text": "按小猪的审美观，隔壁家的宝贝基本算个美女。",
    "file": "voice/line-076.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 76,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 76,
    "text": "主人，天凉了，注意多加衣服哦！",
    "file": "voice/line-077.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 77,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 77,
    "text": "隔壁家的宝贝长的够创意，活的有勇气。",
    "file": "voice/line-078.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 78,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 78,
    "text": "我不是一个人在战斗，因为我身后有很多小弟——苍蝇。",
    "file": "voice/line-079.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 79,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 79,
    "text": "你笑一次，我就高兴好几天！",
    "file": "voice/line-080.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 80,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 80,
    "text": "主人，我们的回忆录畅销全球",
    "file": "voice/line-081.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 81,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 81,
    "text": "快乐要懂得分享，才能加倍快乐。",
    "file": "voice/line-082.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 82,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 82,
    "text": "天啦，我的衣服又瘦了！",
    "file": "voice/line-083.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 83,
    "reason": "idle",
    "index": 83,
    "text": "我以后都骑自行车上街，低碳生活从我做起。",
    "file": "voice/line-084.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 84,
    "reason": "hungry",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "主人，你不带我去吃吃喝喝么？~~",
    "file": "voice/line-085.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 85,
    "reason": "hungry",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "主人，饿肚子的滋味真难受~~",
    "file": "voice/line-086.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 86,
    "reason": "hungry",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "可恶的主人，你一定自己躲着吃大餐吧~~",
    "file": "voice/line-087.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 87,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "有点提不起劲",
    "file": "voice/line-088.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 88,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "不太想动",
    "file": "voice/line-089.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 89,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "你在吗，我闷",
    "file": "voice/line-090.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 90,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 3,
    "text": "想被人摸一下头",
    "file": "voice/line-091.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 91,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "今天不太想说话，但别关我",
    "file": "voice/line-092.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 92,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "我蔫了，你能看出来吗",
    "file": "voice/line-093.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 93,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "有点想你想得多一点",
    "file": "voice/line-094.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 94,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 7,
    "text": "没人理我的时候我在等",
    "file": "voice/line-095.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 95,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 8,
    "text": "需要一点小玩具",
    "file": "voice/line-096.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 96,
    "reason": "blue",
    "index": 9,
    "text": "心情掉了一格",
    "file": "voice/line-097.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 97,
    "reason": "feed",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "吃那么多，我在想，从哪里开始减肥了……",
    "file": "voice/line-098.mp3"
  },
  {
    "globalIndex": 98,
    "reason": "feed",
